14. Common Tricky Interview Questions (4+ Years)
Q1. Is encapsulation only about getters & setters?
❌ No
✔ It’s about controlled access & behavior enforcement

Q2. Can encapsulation exist without setters?
✅ Yes (Immutable classes)

Q3. Does private guarantee security?
❌ No (Reflection can break it)

Q4. Can we override private methods?
❌ No — they are not inherited

Q5. Is encapsulation a runtime concept?
❌ Mostly compile-time
✔ But enforced at runtime too

Q6. How does Lombok affect encapsulation?
Lombok does not break encapsulation
Generates controlled access methods

